notes.content:
Dear Ace Pilot,

During the week since the game officially launched on Steam, we’ve got a lot of pilots’ warm and timely feedback! Thank you very much!
In this update, we gave priority to optimizing some of the frequently raised issues.

Bug fixes

 Fixed: Errors in credits;
 Fixed: Sound effect details on mechas;
 Fixed: Animation details on mechas;
 Fixed: Scene details in levels;
 Fixed: Some situations where player may stuck in singleplayer levels;
 Fixed: In singleplayer and multiplayer, pilot rolls in a direction other than his move direction;
 Fixed: Stablized network game;

Adjustment

 In singleplayer mode, several new control tutorials have been added;
 In the single mode, the experience has been optimized.


We attach great importance to every pilot’s opinions and suggestions, and are still looking for solutions to some of the problems you have raised before. As a small indie game team, due to the lack of teammates and funds, the optimization would take some time. Please give us some more time T-T.

If you encounter any problems, you can contact us through the official community in order to get quick feedback.
Official Community: http://community.rocketpunchgames.com/c/bug-report

We sincerely hope tolisten to your advice and to optimize the game, please continue to support HARDCORE MECHA!
Welcome to the official community to leave your message. Let's make HARDCORE MECHA much more interesting together!
